From: Usman-Siddiqi <119256979+Usman-Siddiqi@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 23:42:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add optional Rust notebook diff and merge acceleration

Use the nbdime_rs extension for notebook diffs and merge decisions when
a compatible build is installed, and keep the Python implementation for
configurations and inputs the extension cannot represent.

NBDIME_ACCEL=0 never imports the extension. NBDIME_ACCEL=force raises
instead of falling back when the extension is missing, incompatible or
reports an error. By default an engine error is logged at debug level
and the Python implementation is used.
